  "bio": "Wagner Olguins is a highly skilled tattoo artist hailing from Uruguaiana, Brazil, who has been perfecting the craft of neotraditional tattoos since 1997. Alongside a portfolio that showcases a mastery in traditional, black and white, and cover-up tattoos, Wagner is widely recognized for maintaining an exceptional level of cleanliness that ensures a safe and hygienic experience for all clients. His dedication to cleanliness in his practice is just as intricate and steadfast as the detailed designs he inks onto the skin.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Uruguaiana, Rio Grande Do Sul, Brazil\n\nWagner Olguins, tatuador desde 1997, especializado em tradicional, preto e branco e coberturas !\n⠀⠀⠀\n⬇️ Orçamentos ↙️",
